{"name": "The Only Droid", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"360\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4393370/extras/4bafc476758ac1c4b8b16266fdbc1d94.poster.avif?t=1781594592\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4393370/extras/4bafc476758ac1c4b8b16266fdbc1d94.webm?t=1781594592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4393370/extras/4bafc476758ac1c4b8b16266fdbc1d94.mp4?t=1781594592\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3164</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>CAN YOU SURVIVE?</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tear enemies apart</strong> piece by piece in this physics-based action roguelite,\u00a0where enemies are a combination of moving parts and exposed weaknesses. Stack upgrades, pick up loot, and adapt your build on the fly as the difficulty increases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"360\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4393370/extras/f1ccd49078664cd85e2d3febc8ec6ac0.poster.avif?t=1781594592\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4393370/extras/f1ccd49078664cd85e2d3febc8ec6ac0.webm?t=1781594592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4393370/extras/f1ccd49078664cd85e2d3febc8ec6ac0.mp4?t=1781594592\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3164</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>TARGET WEAK POINTS</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemies are not just bullet sponges. Target their limbs, destroy their components, and use their exposed weak points to take them down in fast-paced combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"360\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4393370/extras/6902e7423548d83a4de4fa043c6099d0.poster.avif?t=1781594592\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4393370/extras/6902e7423548d83a4de4fa043c6099d0.webm?t=1781594592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4393370/extras/6902e7423548d83a4de4fa043c6099d0.mp4?t=1781594592\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3164</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>TEST YOUR BUILD</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Customize your build before each run, then find new upgrades in the midst of battle. Build up powerful combinations, and create builds that make you a lightning-fast glass cannon, an unstoppable tank, or something completely broken.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"360\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4393370/extras/127a724718e8d9ae9ed99005f2774eee.poster.avif?t=1781594592\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4393370/extras/127a724718e8d9ae9ed99005f2774eee.webm?t=1781594592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4393370/extras/127a724718e8d9ae9ed99005f2774eee.mp4?t=1781594592\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3164</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Discover New Gear</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All items start undiscovered. Find them during your runs, and once revealed, they become permanently available to purchase and use in future loadouts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"360\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4393370/extras/ec31f04339daeccfdbd521149b1dd5f0.poster.avif?t=1781594592\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4393370/extras/ec31f04339daeccfdbd521149b1dd5f0.webm?t=1781594592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4393370/extras/ec31f04339daeccfdbd521149b1dd5f0.mp4?t=1781594592\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3164</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">50+ unique items that create endless synergies and builds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">loadout menu to customize your build.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 different worlds to fight through.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">unique bosses at the end of each stage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">multi-part minibosses that spawn across the map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">15+ weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">physics-based combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3164</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"176\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4393370/extras/ed91f1fdabc21fd5dd6437c0cf4d2441.avif?t=1781594592\" width=\"176\"/></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Tear enemy robots apart piece by piece in a physics-based action roguelike. Destroy weak points, stack upgrades, and create your unique build as you turn relentless robotic enemy waves into mechanical graveyards.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4393370/fc0ee5609770dad7d7c4705356b7b35113d61e72/header.jpg?t=1781594592", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action Roguelike", "Action", "Roguelike", "Roguelite", "Bullet Hell", "Third-Person Shooter"], "developers": "Musab.dev", "publishers": "Musab.dev", "release_date": "2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4393370", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "24 May 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/ohpnjL601qo", "first_seen": 1779573600.0, "review_rank": 603}